get.description:
Streams status updates for an asynchronous operation as Server-Sent
Events. The connection stays open until the operation completes or
fails.

```javascript
const source = new EventSource(
  '/api/organizations/v1/operations/' + requestId + '/stream',
  { headers: { 'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + token } }
);
source.onmessage = (event) => {
  const data = JSON.parse(event.data);
  if (data.status === 'completed' || data.status === 'failed') {
    source.close();
  }
};
```
